---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PixieDust from '../../components/PixieDust.jsx';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Free SEO Audit for Local Businesses"
  description="Get a comprehensive SEO audit for free. We'll review your website and identify opportunities to improve your search rankings."
>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="py-20 lg:py-32 px-4" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-brand-glow text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">✦ Limited-Time Offer</p>
      <div class="relative inline-block">
        <PixieDust client:load />
        <h1 class="font-heading text-6xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl font-bold text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
          Free <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue via-brand-cyan to-brand-sky">SEO Audit</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-sky/80 mb-8">
        Discover what's holding your website back from ranking on Google. We'll provide a detailed analysis and action plan.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="/contact#get-in-touch"
        class="inline-block bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all"
      >
        Request Your Free Audit
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What You'll Discover -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-darkest border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">What's Included in Your Audit</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-sky/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
          A comprehensive review covering all critical areas that impact your search visibility.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Technical SEO Analysis</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We review site speed, mobile responsiveness, XML sitemaps, robots.txt, structured data, and core web vitals.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m0-4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m0-4v2m0-6V4"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">On-Page Optimization</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We check title tags, meta descriptions, heading structure, keyword usage, and content quality across your site.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13.828 10.172a4 4 0 00-5.656 0l-4 4a4 4 0 105.656 5.656l1.102-1.101m-.758-4.899a4 4 0 005.658 0l4-4a4 4 0 00-5.656-5.656l-1.1 1.1"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Backlink Profile Review</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We analyze your backlinks, identify low-quality links, and recommend opportunities for high-authority backlinks.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Competitor Analysis</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We compare your SEO performance with top-ranking competitors in your area and industry.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 21l-6-6m2-5a7 7 0 11-14 0 7 7 0 0114 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Keyword Research</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">We identify high-opportunity keywords your business should target and where you're missing ranking potential.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/5">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-6 text-white">
            <svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-6 h-6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m7 0a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Actionable Recommendations</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/60">You'll receive a prioritized action plan with specific, implementable recommendations to improve your SEO.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- The Process -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-16 text-center">How the Audit Works</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan text-white font-bold">
              1
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Submit Your Request</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Fill out a short form with your website URL and some basic business information. Tell us your biggest SEO challenges.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan text-white font-bold">
              2
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">We Conduct Deep Analysis</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Our SEO specialists use professional tools to crawl your site, analyze your backlinks, and research your keyword opportunities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan text-white font-bold">
              3
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Receive Your Audit Report</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Within 5 business days, you'll get a detailed PDF report with findings, insights, and a clear action plan.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-blue to-brand-cyan text-white font-bold">
              4
            </div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Optional Consultation</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Schedule a call to discuss the audit findings and explore how we can help implement the recommendations.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose Us -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-brand-dark/50 border-y border-white/5">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-16 text-center">Why This Audit is Valuable</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-cyan text-2xl flex-shrink-0">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Identify Hidden Issues</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Many businesses unknowingly have SEO problems costing them visibility. We'll uncover what Google sees when it crawls your site.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-cyan text-2xl flex-shrink-0">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Prioritized Action Plan</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Not all SEO issues are equal. We'll tell you exactly which problems to fix first for maximum impact on your rankings.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-cyan text-2xl flex-shrink-0">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Competitive Insights</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Understand how your SEO performance compares to competitors in your area who are already ranking well.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex gap-4">
          <div class="text-brand-cyan text-2xl flex-shrink-0">✓</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">Revenue Impact</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Better search rankings mean more visibility, more leads, and more customers. Every position on Google matters.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ Section -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-16 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
      
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Is this audit truly free with no obligation?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Yes, completely free. There's no catch and no obligation to hire us. Our goal is to help businesses understand their SEO health.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">How long does it take to receive the audit?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">We'll deliver your comprehensive audit report within 5 business days of your request.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Will I understand the report if I'm not an SEO expert?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Absolutely. We write our reports for business owners, not just SEO professionals. Everything is explained clearly with actionable next steps.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">What if my website is new or has no traffic yet?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">The audit is still valuable. We'll identify technical issues and opportunities to optimize before you invest in marketing.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-darkest p-6 rounded-xl border border-white/5">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3">Can I implement the recommendations myself?</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-sky/70">Absolutely. Some recommendations are easy DIY tasks, others may require technical expertise. We can help if you need it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA Section -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Ready to Discover Your SEO Potential?</h2>
      <p class="text-xl text-brand-sky/80 mb-8">
        Let's see what's holding your website back from ranking on Google.
      </p>
      <a 
        href="/contact#get-in-touch"
        class="inline-block bg-brand-accent text-[#0A0A0A] px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-brand-accent-light transition-all text-lg"
      >
        Request Your Free Audit
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
